        "update_time": null,
        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "It sounds like you’re asking how to make **$220 using only $50 and $20 bills**.\n\nLet’s break it down:\n\nLet:\n- \\( x \\) = number of $50 bills  \n- \\( y \\) = number of $20 bills  \n\nEquation:\n\\[\n50x + 20y = 220\n\\]\n\nDivide everything by 10:\n\\[\n5x + 2y = 22\n\\]\n\nNow find whole-number solutions:\n\nTry \\( x = 2 \\):\n\\[\n5(2) = 10 \\Rightarrow 22 - 10 = 12 \\Rightarrow y = 6\n\\]\n\n✅ Solution:\n- **2 × $50 = $100**\n- **6 × $20 = $120**\n\nTotal:\n\\[\n100 + 120 = 220\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer:\n👉 **2 fifty-dollar bills and 6 twenty-dollar bills**\n\nIf you want, I can show *all possible combinations* too 👍"
          ]
        },
